SCRIPT:BOANarration01
"After Smaug took the Lonely Mountain, King Thrór decided it was time to reclaim the ancient Dwarf Kingdom of Khazad-dûm..."
END

SCRIPT:BOANarration02
"...but an army of Orcs, led by Azog the Defiler, had got there first."
END

SCRIPT:BOABalin01
"Balin: The orcs outnumber us three to one, we have been scattered, and Thrór has been cut off..."
END

SCRIPT:BOABalin02
"Balin: Thráin is holding out as we speak, but for how long?"
END

SCRIPT:BOAThorin01
"Thorin: If we are to have a chance at victory, we will have to rally our forces. First we must aid my father. Come on!"
END

SCRIPT:BOAThorin02
"Thorin: Let them taste Dwarven Steel!"
END

SCRIPT:BOAThrain01
"Thráin: Durin is with us, my son. Soon we will feast in the halls of our ancestors."
END

SCRIPT:BOAThorin03
"Thorin: We may yet, but let us focus on the task at hand. Look beyond."
END

SCRIPT:BOABalin03
"Balin: Orcs have fortified the valley. If we don't destroy their camps, they may flank our main force."
END

SCRIPT:BOAThrain02
"Thráin: Hah! Tremble before the might of the Dwarves!"
END

SCRIPT:BOADwalin01
"Dwalin: By my beard, it seems I've missed the action!"
END

SCRIPT:BOADain01
"Dáin: Don't fret. There's plenty more of these buggers out there."
END

SCRIPT:BOAThrain03
"We've secured the flanks. Now we must aid the King! To battle, Sons of Durin!"
END

SCRIPT:BOAThorin04
"Thorin: Nooooo!!"
END

SCRIPT:BOAThorin05
"Thorin: Du Bekar!"
END

SCRIPT:BOAThrain04
"Thráin: We have littered the valley with their dead. We have victory. Come, Khazad-dûm is ours!"
END

SCRIPT:BOAThorin06
"Thorin: The King is dead, and our army is near spent. If this is victory, then our hands are too small to hold it."
END

SCRIPT:BOADain02
"Dáin: We can't go inside. I have looked through the shadow of the Gate. There, in the darkness of Moria, it waits for you still - Durin's Bane."
END

SCRIPT:BOADain03
"Trolls! Kill those brutes before we are overrun!"
END

SCRIPT:BOABalin04
"Balin: The world must change and some other power than ours must come before Durin’s Folk walk again in Moria."
END

SCRIPT:BOAThrain05
"Thráin: It will be years before we get another chance. Thorin, stay here and take command. I will go now, together with any that dare follow."
END

SCRIPT:BOAThrain06
"That crafty shaman's not going to bother us anymore!"
END

SCRIPT:BOAThrain07
"Ho! That brute's finally bit the dust."
END

SCRIPT:BOANarration03
"With those final words he entered Moria, never to be seen again..."
END

SCRIPT:BOATimer_01
"Thráin gets overwhelmed in"
END

SCRIPT:BOATimer_02
"The Dwarves will be overrun in"
END

SCRIPT:BOAObjective_01
"Save Thráin before the Orcs overwhelm him."
END

SCRIPT:BOAObjective_02
"Destroy all Orc camps in the area."
END

SCRIPT:BOAObjective_03
"Rescue Thrór's host."
END

SCRIPT:BOAObjective_04
"Kill Azog to rally the dwarves."
END

SCRIPT:BOAObjective_05
"Cleanse the battlefield of the remaining Orcs."
END

SCRIPT:BOABonusObjective_01
"Save the scattered Dwarven battalions."
END

SCRIPT:Thrainhealth
"Thráin's Health:"
END

SCRIPT:Thrainwarning_01
"Thráin is growing weaker"
END

SCRIPT:Thrainwarning_02
"Thráin has lost half his strength"
END

SCRIPT:Thrainwarning_03
"Thráin will not last much longer"
END

SCRIPT:Thrainwarning_04
"Thráin will only survive a few more moments"
END

SCRIPT:Trollwarning_01
"Kill the Moria Trolls before you are overrun"
END

SCRIPT:LakeArchers
"Prince Thorin! Our party was routed by the orcs in the valley. We shall help you clear it!"
END

SCRIPT:BalinMirrormere
"It was here that Durin the Deathless saw stars reflected beneath the sun... it was then that he founded Khazad-dûm..."
END

SCRIPT:ThorinMirrormere
"Come then, old friend. Let us honor the memory of Durin and reclaim our sacred halls."
END

SCRIPT:AzogDeadDain
"The King has been avenged, and the red axe has been sated!"
END

SCRIPT:AzogDeadThorin
"Du Bekar!"
END

SCRIPT:AzogDeadBalin
"The beast has fallen, but our labor is not over..."
END

SCRIPT:AzogDeadDwalin
"Raaaah! Which one of you disgusting creatures is next!?"
END

SCRIPT:AzogDeadThrain
"Father... you have been avenged..."
END
